.#-----------------------------------------------------
.input|xhtml/1.0
.# Nested lists whose first item starts with an empty line (empty item, item starting with a nested list): they are
.# separated from the text of the list item in which they're located by an empty line, since a list item starting
.# with an empty line can't interrupt a paragraph
.#-----------------------------------------------------
<html><body><ul><li>a<ul><li></li></ul></li><li>c</li></ul><ol><li>d<ol><li></li><li>e</li></ol></li></ol><ul><li>f<ul><li><ul><li>g</li></ul></li></ul></li></ul><ol><li>h<ol><li><ol><li>i</li></ol></li></ol></li></ol></body></html>
.#-----------------------------------------------------
.inputexpect|markdown/1.2
